      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Because of these kids-obsessed people, half the internet is in ruins or only works through a VPN. How do you decide to determine whether someone is 18 or not? Will you demand a passport and check it? Or is registration in VRChat only possible with a passport? All you want is to create additional problems for everyone and nothing more. This idiocy has been going on in our country since 2012, tilting at windmills. Do you think anything helped? Yes. Kids learned to use VPNs, putting a strain on ISPs. A lot of money tilting at windmills. And also problems for those who are already 18 years old. \n\nIf you want to keep your room 18+, create a forum where you check IDs and grant access to your room, and enjoy. However, you'll be almost alone there, as this issue mostly affects you alone. For example, I'd rather delete VRChat than give anyone my passport. And nothing would stop me from giving someone a photo of someone else's fake adult passport.\n\nIt's just a laugh.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
