      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64ad6386abd973094ca7d793|full_name} Listen, I get its rough. But its easier to moderate and BAN an account that shouldnt be on there, than the current public instance way. Besides, the only thing this post is asking for, is for 18+ instances for those ALREADY verified through VRChat's Age verification. A VPN can't bypass VRChat age restricted instances. 18+ Instances are mainly for smaller groups anyway. Rarely will you see such a LARGE amount of people conglomerate on a whim, unless there's a genuine event going on. Do what you want with your own account, but for some of us with SENSE, this just works.",
