      "value": "@{6a9847bb78a781c4585c0865|full_name}At a minimum, VRChat+ isn't available in all countries. Verification can be bypassed with the help of adults, but that won't save you. However, the creator's ability to set a password for their world and change it could, at a minimum, be shared with anyone they actually know. Finding and obtaining a password for a specific world will be much more difficult than bypassing verification.",
